description "Gungan Warrior

Some of the native Gungans volunteered to assist the mission of reclaiming Theed Palace.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 25% faster RoF
- Gungan Electropole & Shield (Dual/Purple Styles)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Shocks on hit
-- 50% more special damage
- Boomas (4) (Pulse Grenades)
-- 100% more damage
-- Primary fire only

^8Attributes:
- BP Free Jumps
- Bunny Hop (2)
- Slow Faller
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Underwater Breathing
- Getup (3)
- 50% more knockback given
- 50% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Barge ^3[Melee CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Dash/Dash Jump (1) ^3[CS4]"